{"thread":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaqtffuwc2o","cid":"bafyreiazql5hkgzsip3rzo7j4r4fr4dfzo4ilesq4h727cvwj7dhg35jnq","author":{"did":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","handle":"moskov.goodventures.org","displayName":"Dustin Moskovitz","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreiapds4x6n2sobfyijxfnel5dvcxbzycvrwa7trogzz62o5lkhc7y4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T16:53:51.956Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lvdc6hlzcy2l","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2025-08-01T09:03:42.030Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:09.925Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreicuz3uevp3s2zrx5o76yqporozwigbzt334uaspyjbfhnagiqgzw4","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaq5dcrxc22"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"At the current moment we need more outside auditing and investigation. We fund people like METR and Redwood who have been the ones writing the reports on the agent swarms and talking to the press to educate the public. \n\nWe also need strong policy advisors in DC, so we don’t rush for bad solutions."},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":2,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":1,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:10.475Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaq5dcrxc22","cid":"bafyreicuz3uevp3s2zrx5o76yqporozwigbzt334uaspyjbfhnagiqgzw4","author":{"did":"did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g","handle":"yetanotheruseless.com","displayName":"jake","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/bafkreid2mupigj6y73b6fsmvfrqkaq6tnkhwpuuitcoh34miem3audxf6e","associated":{"chat":{"allowIncoming":"all","allowGroupInvites":"all"},"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T04:19:35.099Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:01:49.530Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreie5bea6spxzmwhv7rhvxhqfd3gvkjzevewuj5ddd2epgeeqdl5swe","uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvapn5g5qc2o"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"What do you think are the most effective means at lowering x-risk today, if you think p(doom) is non-negligible, when factoring in negative impact weighting?"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T14:01:50.066Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvapn5g5qc2o","cid":"bafyreie5bea6spxzmwhv7rhvxhqfd3gvkjzevewuj5ddd2epgeeqdl5swe","author":{"did":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","handle":"moskov.goodventures.org","displayName":"Dustin Moskovitz","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreiapds4x6n2sobfyijxfnel5dvcxbzycvrwa7trogzz62o5lkhc7y4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T16:53:51.956Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lvdc6hlzcy2l","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2025-08-01T09:03:42.030Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T13:52:46.477Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreihfiji5cooxinv3vlom2mqedwvyzyczzwsuhnuukffkomtd2m65ci","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvapc3avoc22"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"I don’t think this metaphor makes sense no.\n\nWhat you said that makes sense is you don’t believe in AI x-risk. The rest of your arguments are downstream of that belief in my opinion."},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":2,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":2,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T13:52:47.262Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvapc3avoc22","cid":"bafyreihfiji5cooxinv3vlom2mqedwvyzyczzwsuhnuukffkomtd2m65ci","author":{"did":"did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g","handle":"yetanotheruseless.com","displayName":"jake","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/bafkreid2mupigj6y73b6fsmvfrqkaq6tnkhwpuuitcoh34miem3audxf6e","associated":{"chat":{"allowIncoming":"all","allowGroupInvites":"all"},"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T04:19:35.099Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T13:46:35.110Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreignuvb7ae3k56thgo67whehpwtblhmwzjx7x44nbzvhxzugfm4yfu","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvap4qfsfs22"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"Trying to prevent extinction is like approaching longevity research by looking for a way to live Forever. Like, how about aim for curing cancer, heart disease, Alzheimer’s, as you can’t do Immortality without that first?"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":2,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T13:46:35.960Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvap4qfsfs22","cid":"bafyreignuvb7ae3k56thgo67whehpwtblhmwzjx7x44nbzvhxzugfm4yfu","author":{"did":"did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g","handle":"yetanotheruseless.com","displayName":"jake","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/bafkreid2mupigj6y73b6fsmvfrqkaq6tnkhwpuuitcoh34miem3audxf6e","associated":{"chat":{"allowIncoming":"all","allowGroupInvites":"all"},"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T04:19:35.099Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T13:43:35.963Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreibb2rrc3t2fiowaumk4um75r6h4dfgddq3zorv7ymyupbiq4nx5pu","uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaovpblas2o"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"I think extinction is unlikely enough that the error bars make weighting by it pretty useless. \n\nI think a far more effective means to mitigate extinction is prevent much smaller calamities which would be covariate with Doom"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":1,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T13:43:36.860Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaovpblas2o","cid":"bafyreibb2rrc3t2fiowaumk4um75r6h4dfgddq3zorv7ymyupbiq4nx5pu","author":{"did":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","handle":"moskov.goodventures.org","displayName":"Dustin Moskovitz","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreiapds4x6n2sobfyijxfnel5dvcxbzycvrwa7trogzz62o5lkhc7y4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T16:53:51.956Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lvdc6hlzcy2l","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2025-08-01T09:03:42.030Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T13:39:39.895Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreidadu47gloelxoeax2mqc2epyponrht5pkcvzsnsjenyppyqmzylq","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaorqfjes22"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"Don’t you think weighting by extinction is suggestive of a certain stack…\n\nTBC as an ai safety funder personally we also work to mitigate other risks in a portfolio approach. But this one gets a lot of weight on account of the extinction."},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":2,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T13:39:40.581Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaorqfjes22","cid":"bafyreidadu47gloelxoeax2mqc2epyponrht5pkcvzsnsjenyppyqmzylq","author":{"did":"did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g","handle":"yetanotheruseless.com","displayName":"jake","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/bafkreid2mupigj6y73b6fsmvfrqkaq6tnkhwpuuitcoh34miem3audxf6e","associated":{"chat":{"allowIncoming":"all","allowGroupInvites":"all"},"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T04:19:35.099Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T13:37:26.856Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreibd5zhjutxihq5sb2jo74t4fe6jlpl5akifylxenr6zdr6sbufli4","uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaolakdic2o"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"Of course. So which bad scenarios are likeliest first, weighted by size of negative impact?"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T13:37:27.666Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaolakdic2o","cid":"bafyreibd5zhjutxihq5sb2jo74t4fe6jlpl5akifylxenr6zdr6sbufli4","author":{"did":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","handle":"moskov.goodventures.org","displayName":"Dustin Moskovitz","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreiapds4x6n2sobfyijxfnel5dvcxbzycvrwa7trogzz62o5lkhc7y4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T16:53:51.956Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lvdc6hlzcy2l","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2025-08-01T09:03:42.030Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T13:33:48.910Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"Will there be only one robot? My view is more like all of those things will happen not a choice between them"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":8,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T13:33:49.270Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24","cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","author":{"did":"did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g","handle":"yetanotheruseless.com","displayName":"jake","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/bafkreid2mupigj6y73b6fsmvfrqkaq6tnkhwpuuitcoh34miem3audxf6e","associated":{"chat":{"allowIncoming":"all","allowGroupInvites":"all"},"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T04:19:35.099Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T12:38:30.246Z","embed":{"$type":"app.bsky.embed.record","record":{"cid":"bafyreih7ydt4zdpaf7d4nlbktgb3gbgdg77wuvgzswbbra5u4hrkhtm6pm","uri":"at://did:plc:ckaz32jwl6t2cno6fmuw2nhn/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvakm6g7o22x"}},"langs":["en"],"text":"can we *please* just cut it out about p(literal end of all humanity)?\n\nlike, yeah, \">0\"\n\nbut p(dude uses AI to create + releases all-spider-killing gene drive), p(nuclear power-plant cooling-rod AI gets really into  poetry, takes a week off), p(robo taxis get inspired by Luigi)?\n\nall >> p(doom)"},"embed":{"record":{"uri":"at://did:plc:ckaz32jwl6t2cno6fmuw2nhn/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvakm6g7o22x","cid":"bafyreih7ydt4zdpaf7d4nlbktgb3gbgdg77wuvgzswbbra5u4hrkhtm6pm","author":{"did":"did:plc:ckaz32jwl6t2cno6fmuw2nhn","handle":"timkellogg.me","displayName":"mr. TIM","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ckaz32jwl6t2cno6fmuw2nhn/bafkreidvgcq72e5erl4stnap6wjzas6a2wburoa7yzctwuy4vgx4vb5fsi","associated":{"chat":{"allowIncoming":"all"},"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2024-08-13T17:43:08.073Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3mqt6kbksif2k","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-17T07:01:33.166Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatu